{%- comment -%}
  Package card for sections/actie-korting.liquid.

  The promo is a prepaid one-time charge, not a reduced monthly rate (see CLAUDE.md,
  Pricing pipeline), so the card shows what the first 3 months cost today - struck
  through at their undiscounted worth - and the unchanged monthly rate that follows.
  The discounted figure must never carry a "/mnd" suffix: it is a 3-month total.

  Params: name, hook, popular ("Meest gekozen" or blank), monthly, promo_now
  (promoDiscountTotal - what the 3 prepaid months actually cost) and promo_was
  (monthly x 3, the struck-through figure); both blank when the package has no fixed
  price yet or the promo isn't running. promo_badge, fk (finder_key, for the
  /pages/oplossingen?pakket=<fk> deep link).
{%- endcomment -%}
<article class="acard{% if popular != blank %} pop{% endif %}">
  {%- if popular != blank -%}<span class="acard__flag">{{ popular }}</span>{%- endif -%}
  <h3>{{ name }}</h3>
  <p class="acard__hook">{{ hook }}</p>

  {%- if promo_now != blank -%}
    <div class="acard__price">
      <span class="acard__period">Eerste 3 maanden:</span>
      <span class="was">{{ promo_was }}</span>
      <span class="now">{{ promo_now }}</span>
      <span class="acard__once">eenmalig vandaag</span>
    </div>
    <div class="acard__after">Daarna {{ monthly }}<span class="per">/mnd</span></div>
    <span class="acard__badge">{{ promo_badge }}</span>
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="acard__price"><span class="now">{{ monthly }}</span></div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'pakket', pakket: fk %}">Bekijk pakket<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
</article>
{%- comment -%} Card CSS lives in sections/actie-korting.liquid's stylesheet block: {% stylesheet %} is section-only in Shopify Liquid, not valid in snippets. {%- endcomment -%}
